      "text": "[9:32PM] #Igando #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from Obadore to Isheri Roundabout along LASU Isheri Igando Iba Road, but slow return journey from Lanre to Oko Filling Station due to poor road conditions.\nGood movement towards General Hospital down to College, but slow movement at Igando Phase 1 and 2 due to market and commercial activities.\nGood movement towards Omolade down to Obadore Iyana Iba.\nSmooth traffic from Ikotun Igando Road down to Old Garage, connecting Ikotun Intersection to Ijegun Abaranje Road, with a good return journey.\nBusy traffic from Ikotun Roundabout along Ikotun Idimu Road, but good movement towards Governor Road, connecting Council Roundabout to Idimu, enroute to Isheri Roundabout.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
