      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1938704711592616387",
      "text": "[10PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from CMS bridge to Ijora Olopa, via Offin Canal market stretch.\nSlow movement from CMS Bridge inward Offin Canal due to market activities and high pedestrian influx. However, movement is good after Offin Canal towards Eko Bridge by NEPA intersection.\nSteady movement along Broad Street stretch to Apongbon underneath the bridge, connecting Offin Canal market and Olowogbowo.\nGood movement on Eko Bridge by NEPA intersection inward Apongbon, although there's a report of slow movement on Eko Bridge inward Apongbon due to a breakdown of a truck occupying a lane.\nSmooth traffic descending Eko Bridge inward CMS, Elegbeta Mini Stadium, and Ebute-Ero Market.\nGood movement from Ebute-Ero Market to Leventist through UBA Roundabout, connecting inner and outer Marina.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
